<title>HONG KONG: China Light surges on warrant talk.</title>
<headline>China Light surges on warrant talk.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd rose sharply on Wednesday amid talk of a possible covered warrant issue on the stock, brokers said.</p>
<p>No details yet on the possible issue were yet known, but speculation that the issuer would have to buy stock to cover the warrant fuelled demand, brokers said.</p>
<p>The company shares rose HK$0.80, or 2.43 percent, to an intraday high of HK$33.70 before steadying at HK$33.60 in late trade on volume of 5.26 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
